# All postinstall-downloaded artifacts under the package tree. Per-version,
# per-machine — must never be tracked in git or shipped in the published
# npm tarball. The package.json `files:` allowlist enumerates exactly what
# IS published; these patterns are an additional belt-and-braces guard.

# Pre-v0.2.6 layout (xcframeworks under native/ios/; still kept for any
# consumer that pinned an older version and is left with this tree).
native/

# v0.2.3+ layout: Swift sources extracted into the podspec dir.
ios/Sources/

# v0.2.6+ layout: xcframeworks extracted directly into the podspec dir
# (vendored_frameworks no longer traverses `..`). All-pattern glob so any
# future xcframework name (BarzKit.xcframework, etc.) is covered.
ios/*.xcframework/

# macOS metadata that `unzip` leaves behind when extracting ditto-produced
# zips on macOS.
ios/__MACOSX/

# Gradle daemon / build cache produced when running gradle commands
# inside npm-package/android/ during local Android publish wiring work
# (v0.2.10~v0.2.14). Per-machine state — never tracked.
android/.gradle/
android/build/
